  "prompt": "Treat an explicit empty choices list as a valid upstream response, including in shared dictionary-to-response conversion, sync/async conversion to streaming, stream response construction and the Anthropic compatibility adapter. Return an empty choices list without raising APIError or IndexError and without fabricating an assistant choice. Preserve usage-only responses. Missing choices and choices of the wrong type (including null) remain malformed and should raise APIError with a useful diagnostic identifying choices and the supplied type. Existing tests that deliberately reject [] encode the old behavior and must be updated for this change.",
